BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td 16 TL (How Volcanoes Erupt) Tj T* () Tj T* (A volcano is an opening in the crust of a planet where molten rock escapes.) Tj T* (Magma forms deep underground where rock melts under intense heat.) Tj T* (Because magma is lighter than the solid rock around it, it rises toward the surface.) Tj T* ET
