BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td 16 TL (Eruption) Tj T* () Tj T* (First, magma collects in a chamber beneath the volcano.) Tj T* (Then, pressure from gas bubbles builds up inside the chamber.) Tj T* (Next, the pressure forces magma up through cracks in the rock.) Tj T* (Finally, magma bursts out as lava, ash and gas.) Tj T* (In 1980, Mount St. Helens erupted in the United States.) Tj T* (In 1991, Mount Pinatubo erupted in the Philippines.) Tj T* (In 2010, Eyjafjallajokull in Iceland disrupted air travel across Europe.) Tj T* ET
